{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "95a1d28dcbc025783f5b53bf02a812eab389caaf762842db1d97d794b302ce2d", "ja": "ついに旗のデザインも決まり、準備万端、\n本番を目前に控えたメンバー達。\n考え、悩み、原点回帰したその象徴を胸に、\n恵美、瑞希、歩の3人はステージに挑む。", "zh": "旗帜的样式终于拍板定案，\n成员们做好万全准备，等候正式上场。\n心怀经过苦思、烦恼而回归原点的象征，\n惠美、瑞希、步三个人准备挑战演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "90d1d8c3967e9bd2d0abd5c870050c8a4f80103a0a5f2b72eec00b9eb588e45f", "ja": "（最終リハも無事終了。公演も上手くいきそうな\n仕上がりだ。気になるのは、例の旗の件だが……）", "zh": "（最终排练顺利结束，看来正式公演应该也能圆满完成。\n现在要担心的只剩那面旗帜了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "ed0733c35554c3ccc6bc258741326da7cfc0a945ab4d2848bbaf768b39bc3c3d", "ja": "うーん、やっぱこのブレスレット、\nおそろでつけてるとテンション上がるね♪", "zh": "嗯，大家一起戴上这条手链，\n真的让人很兴奋呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "b18acd7116904ad77ab16a7f71d86ed52cca46d57dc619cde545e51419572b21", "ja": "それに、3人でつけてるから三本の矢です。\nひとりひとりは弱くとも……折れないぞ。", "zh": "而且，三个人都戴着，就有三支箭了。\n就算每支箭都很脆弱，只要绑在一起……就折不断了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f0e8f458e13d9e22fa9b59b2bf9f723dbcce16ea8b76e3900fc24bca84eb81ab", "ja": "射手座の3人は三本の矢……確かにそうだ。\n瑞希、上手いこと言うな！", "zh": "『射手座』的三个成员就像三支箭……确实如此。\n瑞希，你说得很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "05278fae3e8489bcae1ed527b7f96653beab4431cdf7f70e69463767c1c16baf", "ja": "……テレテレッ。", "zh": "……（害羞不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e539195789f5f50b4baa0e41ba442e3aa94a6aab6184695d785777ebd1a579d9", "ja": "なんかさ、このブレスレットをつけてるだけで、\nホントの矢みたいに飛んで行ける気がするんだよな！", "zh": "光是戴着这条手链，\n就觉得我自己真的能像支箭一样飞出去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b6161dc7983ce519dfc243ad505b80c073090097869bdda3b936113dfddbce61", "ja": "いっそ月までいって、アタシらの旗を立ててくるか♪\nアメリカの国旗の横にさ！　イエーイ！　って。", "zh": "干脆就这样飞上月亮，在上面竖立我们的旗帜好了♪\n就插在美国国旗旁边！然后比个「Yeah」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2e8b56c249bae4b7d276048cf927047efd45495ba2006a5f2aff3ea05649750b", "ja": "はは、さすがに月まで行かれると俺が困りそうだ。\n……というか、その旗のことだけど。", "zh": "哈哈，你们要是真的飞上月亮，我可要伤脑筋了。\n……对了，我正好想问那面旗帜的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "694f61541ee4fdae65ca5930f78dfcccec351ac128621b9fca85bf01861d2806", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　旗のコト、\nあれからみんなで話しあったんだよ！　そんでさー。", "zh": "啊，对了对了！\n我们后来也讨论过旗帜该怎么做啰！然后啊──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "03b47e7f9cb4e8aefb2083cb0eb05b315b948fccc40016b83688ab33d67948bd", "ja": "最終的に、原点回帰……、です。", "zh": "最后还是……回到原点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f245751199f4a1591e9cffee1435f05258f7f8d7c4799bf5066e8176d47eee4f", "ja": "原点回帰……と、いうと？", "zh": "回到原点……这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "f72d491e2180d323e8b4803bf95b42830f4876bccb2e355fae3bffe2416a32d0", "ja": "39プロジェクトの、\nこの劇場のアイドルになったこと。", "zh": "我们加入39PROJECT、\n成为了这间剧场的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "98fd440978dc3b808e801f8ebf3ea69cce6f6b1e3c7faeb72ea10e92631f2c62", "ja": "それに、アイドルの仲間に出会ったこと。\n{$P$}にも出会えたこと。", "zh": "并且，认识了其他偶像伙伴，\n也认识了{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb03211c16c1e4bb5720f8941b1881f7b8474edfcfd30c973928c7a53a64010f", "ja": "それってさ、実はアタシ達にとって、\nスゴイ革新の始まりだったんだ！", "zh": "所以啊，这些事情对我们来说，\n其实都是巨大革新的开端！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "154ce23f06f20d497395d04117a28e14e9278abde88adaaf71488d3ddd19ab1c", "ja": "それ考えると、やっぱこのデザインっしょ。\nてか、これ以外ありえないって感じ！", "zh": "于是我们觉得，果然还是这个样式最适合。\n应该说，没有比这个更适合的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d13f369197ebf833e6ce25b03f71817d291e1641cf00549a91009a3e08d8f7a4", "ja": "なるほど……。つまり、旗はこのまま。\nそれが3人の答えなんだな？", "zh": "原来如此……所以，旗帜要维持原样。\n这就是你们三个的答案吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "6765b5410869d5b4191b9d7059e6d739c3e402df7708c0dbb4c4b310390c4eda", "ja": "うん！　まだ始まったばっかだけどさ、\nこの劇場の旗の元で、てっぺんめざすよ！", "zh": "嗯！我们才刚起步，\n所以要在这面剧场的旗帜下，迈向巅峰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "b73bf466889e51a2dd558aa558647a162ab18a0fbed1d801126f8f7b8fc5c59b", "ja": "だからさ、これからもよろしくね？\n{$P$}！", "zh": "就是这样啦，以后也请多指教啰，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c2acb25fe8c267616eedfafd00383d5b5d562d48aed65f395991fc59e348fb8d", "ja": "恵美、みんな……。\nああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "惠美、你们……\n好，当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "30c2d7d332125d22b1d1f9e7a142b66cff60492465880479ba374a9d5e97cbae", "ja": "（ついに公演当日だ。俺にできるのはもう、\nみんなを信じることだけ……！）", "zh": "（终于到了公演当天，\n我能做的就只剩下信任她们了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "8f2ecde4049c553235f7a2f7b7f346a8f2de5477c3bea99349722a985504584d", "ja": "サジタリアス、発見です！\n今日はファイトだよ～♪　おしくらまんじゅっ！", "zh": "发现『射手座』了！\n今天要加油喔～♪挤馒头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "00a91a1cce9ac5dc44ae74c76fd49c05128a42a597fc1523689e6d1632253011", "ja": "麗花ー！　にゃっはは♪　ふたりでまんじゅっ♪\n……ふー、なんか肩の力ぬけてきたよ。", "zh": "丽花！呀哈哈♪两个人一起挤馒头♪\n……呼──感觉我没那么紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d52851d1c343b1436d95ec0b0b439d25f7871bb4ba71d94a0ac575387d42afd", "ja": "みんな～！　自分もきたぞ！　旗のデザイン\nいいねっ、あれ！　すごくしっくりくるぞー！", "zh": "各位～！本人也来啰！\n旗帜的样式很不错喔！很适合喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "189d51ec18e18890096ce18d59ae72b251eec7e57397292e1cdadb071b9459bb", "ja": "響！　ありがとっ！　へへっ、いいだろあれ！", "zh": "响！谢谢！嘿嘿！那面旗帜不错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "f835dfdfce620f8b31b01320cea7388645ffa0d8e39d6313525605788f9b32b1", "ja": "うんうん！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "d00e2bb5943289443487ef7080be03201700eb82569fb18ece8e9b101ebaece8", "ja": "緊張……ガチガチ。ぶるぶる。", "zh": "我好紧张……（全身僵硬）（浑身发抖）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "c6c745a08abb91660ce060038920de5d3b69ff2a4ce4b7f5b67bb9e953b9d56c", "ja": "瑞希ちゃん。大丈夫よ、自分を信じて、\n精一杯やれば、きっと大成功よ～♪　うふふ♪", "zh": "瑞希，你放心，只要相信自己，\n全力以赴，一定就能马到成功的～♪唔呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "42db17cfbb8bad8d46b9ac0f252ea1551198f660af43d9ab5e87dfd5f9f4db27", "ja": "三浦さん……ありがとうございます。心強いです。", "zh": "三浦姊……谢谢你，我放心多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "1db874a64bc901af3b76f1b8b1468042e7aae3da1920d3aa5990b00a3c8fd650", "ja": "それに、私には心強いお守りもあるんでした。\n噛まない、お守り。その名も……。", "zh": "而且，我还有个可靠的护身符。\n让我不会吃螺丝的护身符，它就叫做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee8f633301f340cc9c4acaf53addddfc07ee031a4c62bb4f8a899be95024cc4f", "ja": "は……っ。", "zh": "啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "5030ad2232c2f550464d394230cb53ce627435291e674c5f402061e0d53f7c84", "ja": "ん、どうした瑞希？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "b2e4b67e8de80eb1f15a0ff33ea5e0a0752c605c2740bdd896c619710375f380", "ja": "無い……勝舌石が、無い……。\n家に、忘れてきました……ズーン。", "zh": "不见了……流利石不见了……\n我忘在家里了……（沮丧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d504ae091ee4219e30d691221ed2663afacdd91a252c3ddcb9e83320cc974370", "ja": "そ、そうか……。まあ、あれはたぶん、自転車の\n補助輪みたいなものだ。今の瑞希なら大丈夫！", "zh": "这、这样啊……不过，那个应该就像脚踏车的辅助轮。\n瑞希，你现在不需要依靠它了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_06_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "4c85c74d446ca66fa3f747d2d95a7709cfe9b51fbba8136a89c1fd4a6879cce5", "ja": "{$P$}……。わかりました。\n今日は立ち漕ぎで行きたいと思います。……キリッ。", "zh": "{$P$}……我明白了。\n那么今天我就站着骑车吧……（正色）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
